{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1124605-what-would-your-character-do","id":1124605,"title":"What would your character do ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-03T21:02:40-07:00","id":1124605,"title":"What would your character do ?","content":"I decided to do something fun on here by asking what would your character do in a certain situation. The rules are simple, I give a scenario and you tell me what your character would do.<br /> <br /> The first scenario is this, <br /> You are on a leisure yacht trying to assassinate a Wyrm Tainted crime boss. Suddenly, you are under fire from a guy with a Tommy gun him on the other side of the ship. If you try running towards him, you will be turned into Swiss cheese. What would you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T21:09:10-07:00","id":1124607,"title":"","content":"Couple of questions: Is the boat out at sea? What's around me on the deck? Is it just the guy with the gun?<br /> <br /> \u200bBut my pc would just use jam tech on the gun, spend some rage to close the distance and deal with the dude.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13009,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","user":"BurritoMage","date":". 08-04-2017, 12:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T21:13:59-07:00","id":1124609,"title":"","content":"A submachine gun is not an issue for Garou. Morph to Glabro and charge the punk. You benefit from lethal soak and regeneration, so you are unlikely to suffer any lasting damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T21:24:55-07:00","id":1124613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BurritoMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1124605-what-would-your-character-do?p=1124607#post1124607\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Couple of questions: Is the boat out at sea? What's around me on the deck? Is it just the guy with the gun?<br /> <br /> \u200bBut my pc would just use jam tech on the gun, spend some rage to close the distance and deal with the dude.</div> </div> </div> </div>The boat is out at sea and the gunfire is attracting more of the crime boss' goons. These guys also have guns and are firing in your General direction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T21:26:51-07:00","id":1124614,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1124605-what-would-your-character-do?p=1124613#post1124613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The boat is out at sea and the gunfire is attracting more of the crime boss' goons. These guys also have guns and are firing in your General direction.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThen I go to crinos, let the delirium do its thing and soak the rest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T22:54:59-07:00","id":1124627,"title":"","content":"Good idea for a thread!<br /> <br /> My first instinct would be to dive for cover and sneak up on the goon from some other direction, which would vary according to the size and shape of the yacht. I'd also want to avoid changing forms in plain sight. Here's an idea: duck into a bathroom or a closet to change forms, and when the goons come after you, tear them to shreds -- to shreds I say -- at close range. Bathrooms are also convenient places to step sideways, but at sea, that's a move of desperation that will likely to drop you straight into the water.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-03T23:43:04-07:00","id":1124637,"title":"","content":"If I am Uktena I'd jump to the water and thanx to gift I can outmanouver the guy with the gun. As above garou can take a lot of bullets so the shooter would be dead. If I have a gift reist pain the shooter would be dead quicker. There are a lot of gifts stoping the shooter, depend of rank like Staredown for example .. jam gun, ... apecraft blessing and shoot him better ... a lot of options. Stepping sideways always help too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1784-werewolf43","name":"werewolf43","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1784_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T06:48:48-07:00","id":1124739,"title":"","content":"You could also use Jam Technology to break the gun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T07:28:28-07:00","id":1124761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1124605-what-would-your-character-do?p=1124739#post1124739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could also use Jam Technology to break the gun.</div> </div> </div> </div>You wouldn't break it. That's Gremlins; JT causes it to stop working for a few moments, as does Jam Weapon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T11:01:35-07:00","id":1124838,"title":"","content":"Depending on strength and dexterity, you could also throw deck chairs and other furniture at the shooter as you charge, but the direct head-on charge into gunfire seems like a very Ahroun-like thing to do, and I play a Ragabash. \ud83d\ude01","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T18:11:19-07:00","id":1125029,"title":"","content":"Here is a second scenario<br /> <br /> \u200bYou are trying to infiltrate a Weaver-influenced company's regional office to get information on the company's Board of Directors and stockholders. You arrive at night and the building is lock downed for the night. Using your crinos form would attract both the office's security guards and whatever children of Grandmother Spider are in the building. What does your character do to break in?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12186,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","user":"Killerclown","date":". 08-04-2017, 11:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T20:54:45-07:00","id":1125078,"title":"","content":"Look for open windows to climb or jump to, or look for a way to climb to the roof. Failing that, stepping sideways to get inside the building might be the best option. My character really wouldn't be good at this challenge alone, so he'd be relying on his packmates.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-08T12:12:46-07:00","id":1126403,"title":"","content":"For the first scenario my Metis ahroun Get, Iron-Claws-of-War, would return to breed form, blow several Rage, activating Resist Pain with one action, hurling his Ironhammer fetish at the machine gunner with another, and if they still stand do it again, if not then begin tearing into anyone else not affected by the Delirium.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3198-lunar-falcon","name":"Lunar Falcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3198_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T06:08:27-07:00","id":1127585,"title":"","content":"Sorry if this is necroing but here is a 3rd scenario<br /> \u200bYou and your pack have been tracking down a mysterious artifact collector for three weeks now. You are after this man because he got his hands on a Garou artifact that belongs to your tribe. You have managed to track down one of his partners, a Englishman name Carwell..Before you can question Carwell, he catches a glimps of you approaching and runs into his car and tries to make a run for it. You need to capture him alive for interrogation. What does your character do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T07:03:33-07:00","id":1127609,"title":"","content":"Jam tech to stall out the car and grab him or get a spirit to follow him and deal with him there","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T11:38:27-07:00","id":1127723,"title":"","content":"One week isn't a &quot;necro&quot; at all, in my opinion. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Carwell looks like he knows he's guilty of misbehavior. Instead of trying to capture him immediately, I'd follow him to see where he goes, and then lie in wait for him. He might lead me straight to where his organization is keeping the Garou artifact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T18:54:27-07:00","id":1128293,"title":"","content":"Here is a other scenario. This one however, is Christmas themed.<br /> Some mood music. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FlfHyb397VY\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FlfHyb397VY</a><br /> \u200bIt is Christmas Eve. The town mall is full of people doing last minute shopping. You and your pack have also come to the mall for a more grim reason. You have come to destroy a shipment of Wyrm Tainted toys from Avalon. You have brought one of your kin along to watch over the toy store in the mall and buy any Avalon toy that makes it to the store and destroy it. Unknown to you, while your waiting for the Avalon truck to arrive, a man pulls out a gun and takes everyone in the toy store hostage. Besides your kin, one of those hostages is a Magadon executive. The man, whose name is Alan Birch, a former employee of Avalon Toys, is, according to police, holding the store hostage because he was fired that very same day. However, from what you heard, Alan was seen pacing the store arguing with a Avalon-made teddy bear he calls Simeon. This leads you to decide that Birch is under the influence of a Bane possessed toy. So know you got to find a way to both stop Birch and destroy the shipment of toys without violating the Veil. You better think of a way to solve this before he kills everyone, which may come even quicker with that dammed executive egging him on, calling him a loon.<br /> <br /> What do you do?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T19:06:40-07:00","id":1128296,"title":"","content":"Why? Let the police deal with him. As for the toys, let the monkeys have their toys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T20:23:50-07:00","id":1128320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BurritoMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1124605-what-would-your-character-do?p=1128296#post1128296\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why? Let the police deal with him. As for the toys, let the monkeys have their toys.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bGood point. One idea I had for the Birch part was that he was a member of a cell of The Cult of Despair and there was more than one hostage taker in the store. Another one was the idea that the teddy bear could burst open, revealing a monstrous bane. Also, I figured garou would destroy any wyrm tainted product they could.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T21:24:41-07:00","id":1128705,"title":"","content":"I'd say communicating with fire spirits to have them set the place on fire or just doing it myself. The flames will disrupt the hostage situation and destroy the toys. If I use the master of fire gift then I can try to get the kinfolk to safety without being killed myself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3198-lunar-falcon","name":"Lunar Falcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3198_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T14:22:19-07:00","id":1128960,"title":"","content":"It makes sense to let the police deal with the hostage situation, and that might actually cause a distraction that lets my pack deal with the truck delivering the toys more freely. At this point, I'd go after the truck before it even arrives at the store. With a questing stone, I'd hope the pack could find the truck. Then all you have to do is cause a wreck and a fire -- run out in front of it as glabro when it's going a relatively low speed, for example, get the driver out of the car to help the injured &quot;victim&quot; he hit, and someone else in the pack starts a fire on the sly. That would take two or three pack members, so any others could stay near the mall toy store and deal with any new developments. The possessed teddy bear has got to be destroyed too, so you'd at least want to tail the Ex-Exec, whether he's arrested or gets away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}